86
00:06:58,779 --> 00:07:04,439
Scout could choose his fights so you should use that freedom to focus the people who are most threatening to your team

87
00:07:04,539 --> 00:07:08,419
You need to play as a team better than Blue does on old maps like Gold Rush and Dust Bowl

